### Health check
GET http://localhost:3001/health

### Create a task
POST http://localhost:3001/api/commands/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Implement Event Sourcing"
}

### Get task (replace with the ID from the create response)
GET http://localhost:3001/api/queries/tasks/REPLACE_WITH_ID

### Update task status (replace with the ID from the create response)
PATCH http://localhost:3001/api/commands/tasks/REPLACE_WITH_ID/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "IN_PROGRESS"
}

### Get task again to see updated status
GET http://localhost:3001/api/queries/tasks/REPLACE_WITH_ID
